---
// ForgeFlow Protocol Pipeline Diagram (Desktop SVG + Mobile Cards)
---

<figure class="forgeflow-diagram" aria-labelledby="forgeflow-diagram-caption">
  <svg
    class="forgeflow-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 480"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="forgeflow-diagram-title forgeflow-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="forgeflow-diagram-title">
      ForgeFlow 責任分離與確定性驗證迴圈架構
    </title>
    <desc id="forgeflow-diagram-desc">
      展示人類意圖經有界 Story 契約轉交 Agent 實作，由儲存庫原生 make verify
      執行唯一確定性判決。若驗證失敗則由 Agent
      原地修復，通過後方可交由人類進行架構審查與合併。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="forgeflow-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="forgeflow-arrow-orange"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow-head--orange"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="forgeflow-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow-head--green"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Human Intent Boundary -->
    <g class="forgeflow-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 30)">
      <rect width="260" height="340" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="forgeflow-diagram__badge forgeflow-diagram__badge--blue"
        x="18"
        y="28">HUMAN INTENT</text
      >
      <text class="forgeflow-diagram__title" x="18" y="56"
        >有界規格契約 (Story)</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="72"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--blue"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--blue"
          x="12"
          y="22">story.md</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 目標 (Goal) 與嚴格範圍邊界</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 業務規則、預期錯誤與約束</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 160)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="84"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--blue"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--blue"
          x="12"
          y="22">acceptance.md</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 可驗收準則 (Checkable AC)</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 安全性矩陣 (Fixture Matrix)</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="78"
          >• 基準覆寫宣告 (Superseded)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 256)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="64"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--blue"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--blue"
          x="12"
          y="22">靜態合約防護</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• scripts/story-check (零依賴)</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 1 -> 2 -->
    <path
      class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow"
      d="M290 190 H350"
      marker-end="url(#forgeflow-arrow)"></path>
    <rect
      x="302"
      y="165"
      width="36"
      height="20"
      rx="4"
      class="forgeflow-diagram__label-pill"></rect>
    <text class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow-label" x="320" y="179">派工</text>

    <!-- Column 2: Agent Implementation & Repair Loop -->
    <g class="forgeflow-diagram__card" transform="translate(350, 30)">
      <rect width="260" height="340" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="forgeflow-diagram__badge forgeflow-diagram__badge--orange"
        x="18"
        y="28">AGENT COGNITIVE WORK</text
      >
      <text class="forgeflow-diagram__title" x="18" y="56"
        >最小凝聚實作與修復</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="72"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--orange"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--orange"
          x="12"
          y="22">編碼與測試實作</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 依循 Story 嚴格實作最小變更</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 同步新增／更新對應測試案例</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 160)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="84"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--orange"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--orange"
          x="12"
          y="22">原地修復 (Repair Loop)</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 驗證失敗時定位報錯根因</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 禁止擅自弱化測試與驗收規格</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="78"
          >• 規格衝突時標記 SPEC_BLOCKED</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 256)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="64"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--orange"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--orange"
          x="12"
          y="22">無狀態交接 (Handoff)</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• specs/handoff.md (結構化 YAML)</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Forward Arrow 2 -> 3 -->
    <path
      class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow"
      d="M610 190 H670"
      marker-end="url(#forgeflow-arrow)"></path>
    <rect
      x="622"
      y="165"
      width="36"
      height="20"
      rx="4"
      class="forgeflow-diagram__label-pill"></rect>
    <text class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow-label" x="640" y="179">觸發</text>

    <!-- Column 3: Repository Authority & Review -->
    <g class="forgeflow-diagram__card" transform="translate(670, 30)">
      <rect width="260" height="340" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="forgeflow-diagram__badge forgeflow-diagram__badge--green"
        x="18"
        y="28">DETERMINISTIC GATE</text
      >
      <text class="forgeflow-diagram__title" x="18" y="56"
        >儲存庫原生驗收權威</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="106"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--green"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--green"
          x="12"
          y="22">make verify</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• Format & Lint 格式風格檢查</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• Typecheck 靜態型別與架構合約</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="80"
          >• Unit / Integration 測試與追蹤</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="98"
          >• Exit 0 = PASS, Non-zero = FAIL</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 194)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="74"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--green"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--green"
          x="12"
          y="22">人類審查門檻 (Review)</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 僅 PASS 成果具備審查資格</text
        >
        <text class="forgeflow-diagram__desc" x="12" y="62"
          >• 審核架構取捨與授權合併 (Merge)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 280)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="40"
          rx="6"
          class="forgeflow-diagram__subcard forgeflow-diagram__subcard--green"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="forgeflow-diagram__header forgeflow-diagram__header--green"
          x="12"
          y="25">CI / 本地雙軌同源驗收</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Feedback Arrow: Verification FAIL -> Agent Repair Loop -->
    <path
      class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow forgeflow-diagram__arrow--feedback"
      d="M782 370 V425 H480 V370"
      marker-end="url(#forgeflow-arrow-orange)"></path>
    <rect
      x="520"
      y="413"
      width="220"
      height="24"
      rx="4"
      class="forgeflow-diagram__label-pill forgeflow-diagram__label-pill--fail"
    ></rect>
    <text
      class="forgeflow-diagram__arrow-label forgeflow-diagram__arrow-label--fail"
      x="630"
      y="429"
    >
      FAIL (Exit != 0)：拒絕審查，原地修復
    </text>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View: Semantic Card Stack (Max-width: 48rem) -->
  <div class="forgeflow-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="forgeflow-mobile-card forgeflow-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="forgeflow-mobile-badge forgeflow-mobile-badge--blue"
        >01. 人類意圖邊界 (HUMAN INTENT)</span
      >
      <h4>有界規格契約 (Story Contract)</h4>
      <p>
        <strong>story.md</strong
        >：收斂目標、範圍、業務規則、預期錯誤與硬性技術約束。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>acceptance.md</strong
        >：將意圖轉換為可測試驗收準則，提供明確安全性 Fixture
        矩陣與基準覆寫宣告。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>scripts/story-check</strong>：純 Shell Builtins
        靜態檢查，杜絕規格欄位缺漏。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="forgeflow-mobile-arrow">↓ 派工實作</div>

    <div class="forgeflow-mobile-card forgeflow-mobile-card--orange">
      <span class="forgeflow-mobile-badge forgeflow-mobile-badge--orange"
        >02. 執行實作與修復 (AGENT IMPLEMENTATION)</span
      >
      <h4>最小凝聚實作與修復迴圈</h4>
      <p>
        <strong>嚴格限縮範圍</strong>：只修改當前 Story
        宣告邊界內的程式碼與測試，禁止越界變更。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>原地修復迴圈 (Repair Loop)</strong
        >：驗證失敗時解析報錯並修正根因，嚴禁弱化測試假裝通過。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>無狀態交接 (Handoff)</strong>：上下文耗盡時於 <code
          >specs/handoff.md</code
        > 留下機器可讀的基準狀態與路徑歸屬。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="forgeflow-mobile-arrow">↓ 觸發驗證</div>

    <div class="forgeflow-mobile-card forgeflow-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="forgeflow-mobile-badge forgeflow-mobile-badge--green"
        >03. 儲存庫權威判決 (DETERMINISTIC GATE)</span
      >
      <h4>原生 <code>make verify</code> 驗證權威</h4>
      <p>
        <strong>唯一客觀真理</strong>：涵蓋 Lint、Typecheck、Unit/Integration
        Tests 與架構檢查。Exit 0 判定 PASS，其餘皆為 FAIL。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>門檻防禦</strong>：只有 PASS 的變更才具備人類 Review 資格；FAIL
        直接回退 Agent 修復。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>人類最終仲裁</strong>：自動化 PASS
        僅代表合約滿足，人類工程師保留架構取捨與 Merge 最終決定權。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="forgeflow-diagram-caption">
    ForgeFlow 核心工作流：人類定義有界 Story，Agent 在儲存庫原生 <code
      >make verify</code
    > 嚴格把關下完成修復迴圈，唯有綠燈才進入人類架構審查。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .forgeflow-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__desktop {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__subcard {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .forgeflow-diagram__badge--blue {
    fill: #0284c7;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__badge--blue {
    fill: #38bdf8;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__badge--orange {
    fill: #ea580c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__badge--orange {
    fill: #fb923c;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__badge--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__badge--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__title {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__header {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .forgeflow-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #0369a1;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #7dd3fc;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__header--orange {
    fill: #c2410c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__header--orange {
    fill: #fdba74;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__header--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__header--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__desc {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__arrow--feedback {
    stroke: #ea580c;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
    stroke-dasharray: 6 6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__arrow--feedback {
    stroke: #fb923c;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__arrow-head--orange {
    fill: #ea580c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__arrow-head--orange {
    fill: #fb923c;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__label-pill {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__label-pill--fail {
    fill: #fff7ed;
    stroke: #fdba74;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__label-pill--fail {
    fill: #431407;
    stroke: #ea580c;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__arrow-label {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-anchor: middle;
  }

  .forgeflow-diagram__arrow-label--fail {
    fill: #c2410c;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-diagram__arrow-label--fail {
    fill: #fdba74;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive Styles */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .forgeflow-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .forgeflow-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .forgeflow-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      background: var(--dg-surface);
    }

    .forgeflow-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left-color: #38bdf8;
    }

    .forgeflow-mobile-card--orange {
      border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-mobile-card--orange {
      border-left-color: #fb923c;
    }

    .forgeflow-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-mobile-card--green {
      border-left-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .forgeflow-mobile-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    .forgeflow-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #0284c7;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .forgeflow-mobile-badge--orange {
      color: #ea580c;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-mobile-badge--orange {
      color: #fb923c;
    }
    .forgeflow-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .forgeflow-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #4ade80;
    }

    .forgeflow-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .forgeflow-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .forgeflow-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
    }
  }
</style>
